        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McCormack Estates are delighted to present No.257 Bachelors Walk to the City Centre market. A top floor 1 bedroom apartment conveniently located in the heart of Dublin City.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises of an entrance hallway, storage press, bathroom, open plan kitchen and living area with access to the balcony and a separate bedroom. Bachelors Walk is a secure gated development with well maintained communal gardens and is located right in the heart of Dublin City Centre\r\n\r\nLocated along the River Liffey, every conceivable amenity that Dublin city centre has to offer is on your doorstep, with O'Connell Street, Grafton Street, Temple bar and an abundance of bars restaurants and shops within a short stroll, the location is second to none. There are ample bus services, the Luas and DART are also nearby. Service charges are c.€1,700 per annum.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation;\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway - 0.92m x 3.18m\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.43m x 1.43m\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.64m x 1.75m\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.29m x 2.99m\r\n\r\nBedroom - 2.09m x 3.94m\r\n\r\nBalcony - 3.27m x 0.74m\r\n\r\nTotal Floor area - c.30 Sq.m / 322 Sq.ft\r\n\r\n*Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
